{
  "declaredLength": 1924,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F00100002010000003002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然在我们家人团聚的时候露面，\n真是个不解风情的家伙啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF7136572862114EEC5BB64EBA56E2805A768465F6501997329762FF0C000A771F662F4E2A4E0D89E398CE60C576845BB64F19554A300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "才不是呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "624D4E0D662F54623002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n怎么总是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>……\n我也有话想说！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0BFF0100100001BE01000A600E4E48603B662F001000020100000020262026000A62114E5F67098BDD60F38BF4FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以请让我和\n来电伍的二位一决胜负吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58BF78BA96211548C000A676575354F0D76844E8C4F4D4E0051B380DC8D1F5427FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>愿意的话，\n我倒是可以陪你们玩玩。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C0010000201000000613F610F76848BDDFF0C000A62115012662F53EF4EE5966A4F604EEC73A973A93002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就来吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3167655427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次再说吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B21518D8BF454270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你有时候就是会\n不假思索地先选择拒绝呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4F60670965F650195C31662F4F1A000A4E0D5047601D7D2257305148900962E962D27EDD54403002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有头巾混混它们在就一定能赢！\n不，是必定会赢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981670959345DFE6DF76DF75B834EEC57285C314E005B9A80FD8D62FF01000A4E0DFF0C662F5FC55B9A4F1A8D62FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这里的我，\n欢迎任何卡友来对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD991CC76846211FF0C000A6B228FCE4EFB4F55536153CB67655BF962183002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我实质上也算是个卡娜莉。\n能和两个卡娜莉对战，棒极了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115B9E8D284E0A4E5F7B97662F4E2A53615A1C83893002000A80FD548C4E244E2A53615A1C83895BF96218FF0C68D267814E865427FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战嘛！\n机会难得啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF96218561BFF01000A673A4F1A96BE5F97554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和你们交手倒是可以，\n但胜利是属于我的哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C4F604EEC4EA4624B5012662F53EF4EE5FF0C000A4F4680DC5229662F5C5E4E8E6211768454E6FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想做什么呀？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F3505A4EC04E485440FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是我们赢了，\n就要你来帮忙做卡娜莉面包！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F62114EEC8D624E86FF0C000A5C3189814F6067655E2E5FD9505A53615A1C838997625305FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快让我对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB8BA962115BF9621854273002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次我会秀出真正的实力！\n麻麻鳗鱼王，用超级进化一飞冲天吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B2162114F1A79C051FA771F6B6376845B9E529BFF01000A9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738BFF0C75288D857EA78FDB53164E0098DE51B259295427FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了实现我的策略，\n超级进化吧，龙头地鼠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E865B9E73B0621176847B567565FF0C000A8D857EA78FDB53165427FF0C9F99593457309F20FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "头巾混混！我会灵活运用\n你超级进化后的力量的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59345DFE6DF76DF7FF0162114F1A70756D3B8FD07528000A4F608D857EA78FDB5316540E7684529B91CF76843002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我赢了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118D624E86FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位卡友，\n你想说的事是什么？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D536153CBFF0C000A4F6060F38BF476844E8B662F4EC04E48FF1F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总有一天我要做出一套\n能给卡娜莉小姐穿的衣服！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B67094E00592962118981505A51FA4E005957000A80FD7ED953615A1C83895C0F59D07A7F76848863670DFF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以啊。\n只要是我中意的设计就行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE5554A3002000A53EA8981662F62114E2D610F76848BBE8BA15C31884C3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也给我一套吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为了了解卡娜莉的心情，\n我也需要打扮得和她一样才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F7ED962114E0059575427FF0100100001BE01000A4E3A4E864E8689E353615A1C838976845FC360C5FF0C000A62114E5F970089816253626E5F97548C59794E006837624D884CFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "得了吧～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F974E865427FF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，来，\n这个给你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C6765FF0C000A8FD94E2A7ED94F604E863002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n卡娜莉装扮套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A53615A1C838988C5626E595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个给你。\n是爷爷做的卡娜莉面包！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A7ED94F603002000A662F72377237505A768453615A1C838997625305FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉面包……\n我会珍惜一辈子的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83899762530520262026000A62114F1A73CD60DC4E008F885B507684FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不，你得吃掉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0DFF0C4F605F97540363893002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，还是赢不了你啊。\n麻麻鳗鱼王它们明明都努力锻炼过的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C8FD8662F8D624E0D4E864F60554A3002000A9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B5B834EEC660E660E90FD52AA529B953B70BC8FC776843002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉面包大受欢迎。\n我正在考虑要不要在各地开店！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C838997625305592753D76B228FCE3002000A62116B6357288003865189814E0D89815728540457305F005E97FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "重要的是在现实中也能表达出来，\n我早晚会……加油的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CD89817684662F572873B05B9E4E2D4E5F80FD88688FBE51FA6765FF0C000A621165E9665A4F1A2026202652A06CB976843002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
  ],
